        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-10-18",
        "excerpt": "Law clerk, Hon. Henry J. Friendly, U.S. Court of Appeals for the Second Circuit, 1979-1980; Law clerk, Hon. William Rehnquist, Supreme Court of the United States, 1980-1981; Special assistant to the Attorney General of the United States, 1981-1982; Associate counsel, President Ronald Reagan, 1982-1986; Private practice, Washington, D.C., 1986-1989, 1993-2003; Principal deputy solicitor general, U.S. Department of Justice, 1989-1993. Chair of the board, Federal Judicial Center, 2005-present. Presiding officer, Judicial Conference of the United States, 2006-present.",
